457	    /// # Failure
458	    ///
459	    /// Will return `None` if the column index is out of bounds or if the
460	    /// parameter is positional.
461	    ///
462	    /// # Panics
463	    ///
464	    /// Panics when parameter name is not valid UTF-8.
